{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38173","headline":"重和大庆堂赐宴元璫而有诗呈吴越王 · 韩偓","name":"重和大庆堂赐宴元璫而有诗呈吴越王","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冷宴殷勤展小园，舞鞇柔輭彩虯盘。\n篸花尽日疑头重，病酒经宵觉口乾。\n嘉树倚楼青琐暗，晚云藏雨碧山寒。\n文章天子文章别，八米卢郎未可看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}